The '''Salin Corridor''' was a [[hyperspace route]] in the [[Outer Rim Territories]].<ref name="RO World Locations" /> The [[planet]] [[Dathomir]] was in the region of the Salin Corridor and the [[Hydian Way]].<ref name="Dawn">''[[Dawn of Rebellion]]''</ref> The planet [[Quell]] was also positioned on the Salin Corridor.<ref name="BMF 75" />

